## Interface: 16001
## Title: TooltipFold
## Notes: Folds other addons' tooltip lines into Blizzard's own: Pawn's upgrade beside the stats, RestedXP's guide lines merged and only for guides near your level, Meionomics' verdict under Sell Price. Shift shows the detail. /tooltipfold
